      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "So I hit upon a genius idea! If the Resistance and the Miniknog could just talk it out, then maybe things could get smoothed over. I'm sure Big Ape is not the villain they think, if only they'd get to know him. So I tunnelled out of my room and found the nearest Miniknog platoon."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "だから私は天才のアイデアを打ちました! もしレジスタンスとミニノグがそれを話せば、事態は平滑化されるかもしれない。 ビッグ・エイプは、彼らが思う悪人ではないと思います。もし彼を知ることができれば。 そこで私は部屋からトンネルを抜け出して、一番近いミニノグ小隊を見つけました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Filled with positivity, I led them to the Resistance hideout and told them that if they didn't sort out their differences, I'd knock their heads together. So smart! Well, I think it went okay! I didn't stick around to find out for sure, of course, I had to meet back up with Greenfinger, but I saw them all marching together through the town square as we left."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "正当性に満ちていた私は、レジスタンス隠れ家へ彼らを導き、もし彼らが彼らの違いを区別しなければ、私は彼らの頭を一緒にノックするだろうと彼らに言った。 賢い! まあ、うまくいったと思います! もちろん、私はグリーンフィンガーと会わなければならなかったが、私が去ると、みんなが町の広場を行進しているのを見た。"
    }
  ],
